<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay names new agriculture minister.</title>
<headline>Paraguay names new agriculture minister.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguayan President Juan Carlos Wasmosy Wednesday named Cayo Franco his new agriculture and livestock minister.</p>
<p>The 41-year old Franco will replace Juan Borgognan, who resigned Tuesday for health reasons.</p>
<p>Franco has been deputy agriculture minister since 1995</p>
